          "p": "While ordinary tycoons still hesitate over whether to get a US/European green card, Justin Sun used real money to obtain Grenada citizenship, and even through diplomatic maneuvering became Grenada's Permanent Representative to the WTO (a roving ambassador with full powers). In finance this is called sovereign-identity escalation. Under the common-law and international-law framework, an identity with diplomatic immunity means any secular state's administrative or judicial body wanting to physically arrest or search him must cross an extremely high international-diplomatic-immunity barrier. With identity, he built an injury-proof golden body around his physical self."
