          "p": "Those buying pension-type insurance truly care not how much the account grew this year, but **how much is inside on the day I draw, 30 years later.** This piece skips the sentiment and places the two tools at the same starting line, running the 30-year long cycle.\n\nAssume: RMB 100k equivalent invested yearly for 10 years, withdrawals starting year 20.\n\n> Tools showing no gap short-term often end worlds apart at the 30-year mark."
