          "p": "**Stage 1: Consultation and plan design (1–2 weeks)**\n- Clarify goals (retirement/education/inheritance), budget, currency preference\n- Advisor presents 2–3 comparison plans; you choose a direction\n\n**Stage 2: Booking the Hong Kong trip (as needed)**\n- Currently some products support mainland video signing, but mainstream savings policies still recommend signing in Hong Kong\n- Book the insurer, medical exam (if needed), signing time\n\n**Stage 3: Signing in Hong Kong (1–2 days)**\n- Bring ID, entry permit, entry slip, address proof\n- Meet advisor, sign documents, complete underwriting questionnaire\n- Pay premium (card/bank transfer)\n\n**Stage 4: Underwriting and activation (1–4 weeks)**\n- Insurer reviews health and financial materials\n- Once approved, the policy is issued; you receive paper or electronic policy\n- Within the cooling-off period (21 days) you can surrender without loss"
