      "title": "The Compounding Logic of Hong Kong Savings Insurance: Why a 6%–7% Long-Term IRR Is More Reliable Than It Looks",
      "subtitle": "HK Insurance Academy · The Magic and Limits of Compounding",
      "date": "2026-08-22",
