          "p": "**Will**\n- Pros: simple, cheap, covers all asset types\n- Cons: goes through probate, slow, public, dispute-prone\n- Fits: a basic arrangement where the asset structure is simple and the amount isn't large\n\n**Insurance**\n- Pros: automatic distribution, zero maintenance, debt isolation, no probate\n- Cons: only covers policy assets, functions have a ceiling\n- Fits: the \"main force\" of succession for the vast majority of families\n\n**Trust**\n- Pros: strong control, fine-grained distribution, cross-jurisdictional, holds non-policy assets\n- Cons: high threshold, expensive maintenance, complex structure\n- Fits: ultra-high-net-worth families with complex structures"
